{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_2_014hid_02_1_2_014_02",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:66fec0f76dc7413574aeed9e8f48245ec24ccf0d1c9c8f592f2e9d4ab4c73319",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_2_014hid_02_1_2_014_02:1_2_014_02_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bc8cee7f329649f8133b674104e20416b4245af745f445a297a462da6dc7e60a",
      "text": "3月7日的“特别工作”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_014hid_02_1_2_014_02:1_2_014_02_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:68247e4b0a01e9fc0f9fe4ee3cd7717dafb20845c17ae2c66b61f3117dd6584f",
      "text": "英雄接到了在生日当天的单独工作委托。受到龙和诚司的鼓励，他怀着万全的状态迎来了当天，但在现场等待着英雄的，却是意想不到的特别工作……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_014hid_02_1_2_014_02:1_2_014_02_a:cmd-000018:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2b09bcd6e18d66980a219b2c252065efab172f9d4ca056860b35d17112afe537",
      "text": "第2话",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_014hid_02_1_2_014_02:1_2_014_02_a:cmd-000018:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bc8cee7f329649f8133b674104e20416b4245af745f445a297a462da6dc7e60a",
      "text": "3月7日的“特别工作”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_014hid_02_1_2_014_02:1_2_014_02_a:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4c807919d84799ecb511846c14574726d8c75981ccce31874e5b3d4f45bdf284",
      "text": "辛苦了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_014hid_02_1_2_014_02:1_2_014_02_a:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1429ad4f63bd808d44b947b715b2a85ef8f8aa3eab133fad130f5f4a2f70a471",
      "text": "……我、我是最后一个吗？\n你们两个真早啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_014hid_02_1_2_014_02:1_2_014_02_a:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fe1ecdcee94f6eaba2445e06acad26da929dec5e6a273b0d007a30b13451c348",
      "text": "是的，因为有点事。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_014hid_02_1_2_014_02:1_2_014_02_a:cmd-000064:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:735130a89e86e8db9344f2155bb5d3842eb9847471334660eadc6b69139a141f",
      "text": "因为有些话想和制作人聊聊。\n我和龙来得稍微早了点。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_014hid_02_1_2_014_02:1_2_014_02_a:cmd-000070:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6eac396bacbd66e5e0065c5336882e2e21b7253c75218bd948a72ee4a6450032",
      "text": "不管怎么说，大家都到齐了。\n赶快开始碰头会吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_014hid_02_1_2_014_02:1_2_014_02_a:cmd-000075:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4f0feee042273493e648a6ebc703bfe9fff4eda8588d913c6ae0a6c8a5c3d134",
      "text": "好的，今天主要是确认各自的日程安排，\n以及说明新工作。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_014hid_02_1_2_014_02:1_2_014_02_a:cmd-000082:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:05fd3472371306893a166d8f64263170b505a0c73892d38ab31fb8a4ce1ae233",
      "text": "我把资料复印件传过去！\n给，英雄先生这份。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_014hid_02_1_2_014_02:1_2_014_02_a:cmd-000090:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0c7460e397ba67c07a2599a18e35ef62b8b8b0e6b53af152db70301bd1b1c27a",
      "text": "噢，多谢。\n……嗯？也有我的个人工作啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_014hid_02_1_2_014_02:1_2_014_02_a:cmd-000106:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6fd43cc7870739dd3ec460cba6e093c286a8209d188bde1b7a23c8da6d5b365e",
      "text": "内容是繁华街的美食探店啊。拍摄日期是……\n3月7日……这天也安排了工作啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_014hid_02_1_2_014_02:1_2_014_02_a:cmd-000109:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:94a322b069cb16f00323709b596b5593cfd425fd8f9a1e138f1c0fab96219c5a",
      "text": "哎！\n在英雄先生的生日当天！？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_014hid_02_1_2_014_02:1_2_014_02_b:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ffa21dd66303ead1480628e71b669ca60fe2ef3877cfa5e28f913a44d9b429bb",
      "text": "你们明明说了要帮我庆祝的，\n生日当天看来有点悬了。抱歉啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_014hid_02_1_2_014_02:1_2_014_02_b:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0e6b17b0e20a652513961bd339f5714f16339d10a24212c6dc2f6a7650aa3399",
      "text": "没关系。\n我过生日的时候，也改了日程吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_014hid_02_1_2_014_02:1_2_014_02_b:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:920113bcbcf814ce12bd5debb65ec793f08250c712ea5e973451003639b6a8a0",
      "text": "是啊。英雄先生的庆祝，\n我们也重新定个日子办吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_014hid_02_1_2_014_02:1_2_014_02_b:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:56704d36ba0121363e6c1971893cb320452bf68511e98b9f85f0dcf187c2f70b",
      "text": "哈哈，谢谢你们。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_014hid_02_1_2_014_02:1_2_014_02_b:cmd-000055:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:efe481d49693b6384900a7c8cb2f9d63dc0c1996840712bfe01604df9ff7af51",
      "text": "不过，生日那天有工作进来也是个好兆头啊。\n这是新一年的开始，我会好好加油的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_014hid_02_1_2_014_02:1_2_014_02_b:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c80612b42fcc6152c4dc21aa5201fe037481460a2f6c39bdedd852dda7dc9837",
      "text": "啊啊，为你加油。全力以赴去干吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_014hid_02_1_2_014_02:1_2_014_02_b:cmd-000065:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f870571849340aabe35a9fb4f14eef3d3401e68d49b68088d988f1552b4c92a7",
      "text": "我们也会为了给英雄先生准备庆祝，\n全力以赴加油的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_014hid_02_1_2_014_02:1_2_014_02_b:cmd-000071:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ecf9489fbe8953a96b788238fc67d7aaeb9ef2aeed016548b3dcfc2890002911",
      "text": "我会和诚司先生一起好好庆祝的，\n敬请期待吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_014hid_02_1_2_014_02:1_2_014_02_b:cmd-000077:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e97e889d6819e29f78d48624165803c364e32133a5d40f67289e9a5a023fb322",
      "text": "多谢。我很期待哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_014hid_02_1_2_014_02:1_2_014_02_c:cmd-000011:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0caba00123987c65267cb553eff1c391af5c1350a25058166325804f0b0c7b21",
      "text": "生日当天……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_014hid_02_1_2_014_02:1_2_014_02_c:cmd-000021:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:71848eb07181ee9fa2efb87a921d84057e30f422a23bd8f034d558feef528f81",
      "text": "我来说明一下今天的拍摄流程。\n首先，拍摄前的最终确认在休息室进行。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_014hid_02_1_2_014_02:1_2_014_02_c:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7c61a4cf8d8ec174c1df7839240d1a74a42c1527d0e4fdd3c5b57e25234d0d85",
      "text": "……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_014hid_02_1_2_014_02:1_2_014_02_c:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:316bcb65e82f0a0b30e19708702f95fdaf7b626bbf7d2c3cb74b43d9b7c1a2e3",
      "text": "（台词确认没有问题。\n剩下的就是正式开拍时不要出错）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_014hid_02_1_2_014_02:1_2_014_02_c:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:12e6e286122d7c0bc7ba66e8e813ed794fd71d5e2b5f6a257339d4301658de34",
      "text": "然后步骤确认完毕后就直接进入拍摄……\n那个，英雄先生？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_014hid_02_1_2_014_02:1_2_014_02_c:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e7436ed1d3b2c3e4a222037989aab310257dce2057c65a37e6471e236f8e8564",
      "text": "嗯？啊！抱歉，我有在认真听。\n一想到必须好好表现，就不由自主走神了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_014hid_02_1_2_014_02:1_2_014_02_c:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:78f7892ed79119fce5fe354775cf602e616e25b8716890fdbe6e2445f27d0afd",
      "text": "只要按平时的表现来就没问题的。\n放松心情加油吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_014hid_02_1_2_014_02:1_2_014_02_c:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ccf82634965411cdaa73f140a2842ba4400eaea4866d2010895a0e0afedbf2bd",
      "text": "放松……是啊。\n谢谢你，制作人。包在我身上吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_014hid_02_1_2_014_02:1_2_014_02_c:cmd-000069:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:15127ab8928e054baacff861102348bf08c5014a47f06d1e70941b7fcbee1f73",
      "text": "（说起来，今天早上龙和信玄发来的\n庆祝LINK里也给我加油打气了呢）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_014hid_02_1_2_014_02:1_2_014_02_c:cmd-000082:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1752249c425f9b1631335e3ae2cbe4a0f584bd9d9a45517de1e0ce57a11d0df9",
      "text": "祝您生日快乐！\n我们一边准备派对一边为您加油！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_014hid_02_1_2_014_02:1_2_014_02_c:cmd-000084:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ca6d2a2a6cd92367b4a8a71c87e159f9815bee6494c7eab17347332fc86f6f66",
      "text": "生日快乐。\n今天也像平时一样享受拍摄吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_014hid_02_1_2_014_02:1_2_014_02_c:cmd-000093:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7c61a4cf8d8ec174c1df7839240d1a74a42c1527d0e4fdd3c5b57e25234d0d85",
      "text": "……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_014hid_02_1_2_014_02:1_2_014_02_c:cmd-000097:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d42ff4afc5ca1e2c9d541b536962155d5f801132956ef46953f09f51e97c7d47",
      "text": "好，我的新一年又要开始了。\n打起精神来！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_014hid_02_1_2_014_02:1_2_014_02_d:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f977ff952232ae027c4254d6307a5c8a9917a68b180bc882486f54c82735dc3a",
      "text": "打扰了！\n我是315 Production的握野英雄……哇啊！？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_014hid_02_1_2_014_02:1_2_014_02_d:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:422a21cde551d01007396c56b4d2bfaca118f14703dd78c7700c12d667050983",
      "text": "祝您生日快乐！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_014hid_02_1_2_014_02:1_2_014_02_d:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d28caf1297d8fdfa4d4711f3dc26c9674b5ea52ccc510596821af14721e8a2e9",
      "text": "什……哎！？\n你们两个，怎么会在这里！？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_014hid_02_1_2_014_02:1_2_014_02_d:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:487ca47924aec9614d4801abc39abbed916607e2fab3029cfc3075a3fc283ae3",
      "text": "啊哈哈，其实今天英雄先生的工作\n不是美食探店，而是生日会直播哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_014hid_02_1_2_014_02:1_2_014_02_d:cmd-000055:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0020080a5336bd6239296fca7400593058aa47fd426a6b36b488ffa228de4817",
      "text": "吓了一跳吧。你看，屏幕对面的\n粉丝们也送来了这么多的祝福哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_014hid_02_1_2_014_02:1_2_014_02_d:cmd-000062:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1255d1093f7ebdf102c1da86530256be43bd0cf987644acf7581d236b174d18b",
      "text": "等、等一下。\n这个现在正在直播中吗！？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_014hid_02_1_2_014_02:1_2_014_02_d:cmd-000067:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:65e81eb9b97a682effe1f2a038fad33285a1e70cbe6f1c374b975574b6543a24",
      "text": "刚才不是说了是直播吗。\n来，主角快到镜头前去。大家都在等着呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_014hid_02_1_2_014_02:1_2_014_02_d:cmd-000081:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dbdb192d746db62c5d195551512ef71d20767fa94a5b1919cfae0e8c203b35c5",
      "text": "噢、噢……\n我现在脸上的表情僵硬吗？没问题吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_014hid_02_1_2_014_02:1_2_014_02_d:cmd-000091:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4f51f7eaf1f4729b45e1794c7ba212bc01239d6150b08176fed0e9a3624b9dc8",
      "text": "没问题，现在也是英雄先生一贯凛然帅气的表情！\n啊，弹幕也说没问题呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_014hid_02_1_2_014_02:1_2_014_02_d:cmd-000101:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d18e94d084d938b17069b9b5821e1737ff804275b2c7b19e1a9d75a53fd50f9b",
      "text": "真是的，大家全都跟着瞎起哄……\n不过这工作真让人高兴啊，谢谢你们！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_014hid_02_1_2_014_02:1_2_014_02_e:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6a16d99ff92b112d3e3122695089a7569eddd98199ac503185d962f2f697f500",
      "text": "今年的蛋糕也是大家一起烤的。\n如果不介意的话请尝尝吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_014hid_02_1_2_014_02:1_2_014_02_e:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4358e19f3772ca3934c57261a3fb8b37951e410887d8119a89dbbceb14cea531",
      "text": "我不小心烤焦的地方，也被诚司先生\n巧妙地补救了哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_014hid_02_1_2_014_02:1_2_014_02_e:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:989149075fd4da6956b3b0b1ce283fc9416827b0fc7cef4daa9c569b6e6174c3",
      "text": "哈哈，说出来不就穿帮了嘛。\n不过真好吃啊，某种意义上这也算是美食探店的工作了吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_014hid_02_1_2_014_02:1_2_014_02_e:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d4742cae524736ce3c9442d9e7f346f9fb43c0a1ca8e90010a4e711380910862",
      "text": "那么请务必来一段美食点评！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_014hid_02_1_2_014_02:1_2_014_02_e:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:096fadba9e67ecf2b8cd4ccfc00e408d5fab4b93dfc6b70cf81af27f249cea40",
      "text": "吧唧吧唧……怎么说呢……\n光是吃下去就能让人超级幸福，最棒的蛋糕了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_014hid_02_1_2_014_02:1_2_014_02_e:cmd-000065:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:736f3eb32bb03e7be4c565a859dbad415d136be303257ca312f9e631729f2fe8",
      "text": "哈哈。谢谢。对了，礼物也\n准备好了。那边的评价也拜托了哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_014hid_02_1_2_014_02:1_2_014_02_e:cmd-000070:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ee507ecff97fea6a6a59bc499386b19535d2680d10d9a1f12a07347d28ce644e",
      "text": "哇，不知不觉观看人数和评论数都这么多了！\n英雄先生，也读一读评论吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_014hid_02_1_2_014_02:1_2_014_02_e:cmd-000088:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:01d20eb2ddddce7c4cedabec6cd91f512d9aa82f1e85c9e4d5c12e483524e00b",
      "text": "我看看……“超祝生快！”\n噢，超3Q？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_014hid_02_1_2_014_02:1_2_014_02_e:cmd-000097:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:02cafa1f65f5ca5e2b966eb59e6ba1b916902987e90a7bab37c9c65b9b192027",
      "text": "接下来是……“看到特别直播就觉得绝对是英雄生诞！”\n太厉害了，我可是完全没注意到啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_014hid_02_1_2_014_02:1_2_014_02_e:cmd-000104:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d7b8cce284cf219c87966df166397daadf600f3bcc1f2f5523c18b76bcd1c56b",
      "text": "……在屏幕对面能得到这么多粉丝的\n祝福，真的很幸福。谢谢大家。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_014hid_02_1_2_014_02:1_2_014_02_e:cmd-000109:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cc8626166bb602fcb107bb979c091f6d21ce30caae10bc6aad6ac24a67278533",
      "text": "这份谢意，就用今后的工作来报答各位吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_014hid_02_1_2_014_02:1_2_014_02_e:cmd-000130:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7f8a3716e37d0a9ad503014a2ec1149fbf204aaa8dacf131282ec3d4f016ff09",
      "text": "我也是同样的想法。\n而且我认为只要在这个组合里就能实现。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_014hid_02_1_2_014_02:1_2_014_02_e:cmd-000136:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9df99c9204bf6f21de1ad585b754743452fb023d27f8625a0075ed234cdc5bd5",
      "text": "我也是！\n今后三人也齐心协力一起努力吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_014hid_02_1_2_014_02:1_2_014_02_e:cmd-000143:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d2a4188ecf05d683983f5a1d00f8182f93ee97ff589cfdf26a8279ee9e55be11",
      "text": "噢。\nFRAME的三个人，一起齐心协力加油吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
